{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>TVB藝人楊明在大馬開設的燒臘店「豐六道」遭八打靈再也市政廳（MBPJ）查封！</p><p>根據網民分享照片，張貼在「豐六道」店外的通告顯示，店鋪從下午1時起被勒令關閉。通告也顯示，店方涉及違反餐飲場所相關條例或執照條件，同時當局基於公共利益下令關閉。</p><figure><img alt=\"楊明大馬燒味店被查封。（馬來西亞東方網提供）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260824/1168584553246232576510873.jpeg/fvIOBbzlgZs82n9kDCXR0aWwL63aexWkbmDeLW5g3i0\"/><figcaption>楊明大馬燒味店被查封。（馬來西亞東方網提供）</figcaption></figure><p>楊明大馬燒味店開張10日突遭查封：</p><figure><img alt=\"楊明大馬燒味店被查封。（馬來西亞東方網提供）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260824/1168584752492449792894165.jpeg/l_2Tv7c4WcSOIs2vKIxuRpkT5yaeKWlG9IAPxfSAD8U\"/><figcaption>楊明大馬燒味店被查封。（馬來西亞東方網提供）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"楊明在大馬開張的燒味店。（IG＠matyeung）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260824/1168586965709623296751239.jpeg/J9w0MQO54R1xKCtpF6bfXNY4ItaXSbJXrDO8nawzvJ0\"/><figcaption>楊明在大馬開張的燒味店。（IG＠matyeung）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"楊明在大馬開張的燒味店。（IG＠matyeung）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260824/1168586963608145920359078.jpeg/Ow9ZJ-hb7voKY_fsOAm0rQrC_rFBF5A1CNjAnwjYwJ8\"/><figcaption>楊明在大馬開張的燒味店。（IG＠matyeung）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"楊明在大馬開張的燒味店。（IG＠matyeung）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260824/1168586961548611584168423.jpeg/uBUxfCbeeAEknlGfSfBFOls_jytYcPsf--OQdfvjkHU\"/><figcaption>楊明在大馬開張的燒味店。（IG＠matyeung）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"楊明在大馬開張的燒味店。（IG＠matyeung）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260824/1168586959254196224972805.jpeg/kXZp4ZY7BUB3raUrXLId2irXDJ-3gtvxjGr7d4xq-3c\"/><figcaption>楊明在大馬開張的燒味店。（IG＠matyeung）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"楊明在大馬開燒味鋪。（IG@matyeung）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260714/1153649230322470912160587.png/QJTZB4TXTfzRn0wGdhcYQWKyRFfZU7SmT6iiuk-ooro\"/><figcaption>楊明在大馬開燒味鋪。（IG@matyeung）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"自嘲在TVB撈唔掂。（IG@matyeung）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260714/1153649227466018816651298.png/P8odhh3p5NzeijpyFwpoamNHkAwa54D2xo_6D8aP-g8\"/><figcaption>自嘲在TVB撈唔掂。（IG@matyeung）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"出來闖天下做生意。（IG@matyeung）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260714/1153649224873807872318046.png/L7yYmw6bKATpzleghIeUbfc1cbbgEnSxKm5c2ypuXNs\"/><figcaption>出來闖天下做生意。（IG@matyeung）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"自稱做「胡椒燒鴨」全大馬第一間。（IG@matyeung）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260714/1153649222134796288631524.png/kXc-33-Ga3T1MEfMIlMS5-rQ7mXAMUdNAa_JlgGvyZY\"/><figcaption>自稱做「胡椒燒鴨」全大馬第一間。（IG@matyeung）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"楊明開設的燉湯店實體門市於2022年全線結業。（IG@lisa_chng）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260714/1153650055509446656956032.png/UCltUQK_njQFXOhuUOa8u3BWGLL1joSXw6DEScOgxEk\"/><figcaption>楊明開設的燉湯店實體門市於2022年全線結業。（IG@lisa_chng）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"楊明飾演大龍生世敵雷公（白彪飾）親生仔「虹豆沙湯遠」。(《愛．回家》截圖)\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20230713/756255827689476096260194.jpeg/IREwCbYYoJzSvohglf55jUM7uH_7h6UhMcUYEzHFGBM\"/><figcaption>楊明飾演大龍生世敵雷公（白彪飾）親生仔「虹豆沙湯遠」。(《愛．回家》截圖)</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"莊思明楊明拍拖10年。（IG/@lisa_chng）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260605/1139554758651154432236049.jpeg/0AHtqfV78A9bTQFSc3XvbOF4r7CHDyug3QoQbN0KEGw\"/><figcaption>莊思明楊明拍拖10年。（IG/@lisa_chng）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"喜帖曝光！\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260605/1139554454584954880590321.jpeg/R9rkrf2K_Yg1rMMXHdpCbB04YSUHfG0hAlH7kQJR-5E\"/><figcaption>喜帖曝光！</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"莊思明和楊明結婚照。（IG@lisa_chng）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260402/1116404051299536896607521.jpeg/HWZm2ad9qywj3kkWWPXT9nWYCW5BgajGU44AEFOOABA\"/><figcaption>莊思明和楊明結婚照。（IG@lisa_chng）</figcaption></figure><p>楊明於八打靈再也SS2開設的「豐六道」上個月開始試營業，隨即吸引不少食客前來朝聖，生意相當火爆；「豐六道」8月14日正式開張，沒想到僅10天便突然停業。</p><p>至於具體違反哪一項規定，以及何時能重新營業，仍有待店方或MBPJ進一步說明。</p><p>【延伸閲讀】莊思明傳家族身家8億　曾霸氣護楊明非食軟飯：冇用過我一分一毫（點圖放大瀏覽▼▼▼）</p><figure><img alt=\"【延伸閲讀】莊思明傳家族身家8億　曾霸氣護楊明非食軟飯：冇用過我一分一毫（ig@lisa_chng）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260605/1139568896848695296560789.jpeg/5V5KPM1hqunLA-Xyqcq_Fn-gFDhxt17migxjBIoMYwQ\"/><figcaption>【延伸閲讀】莊思明傳家族身家8億　曾霸氣護楊明非食軟飯：冇用過我一分一毫（ig@lisa_chng）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"楊明駕駛曾遇意外，送院時爛醉如泥，需由2名警員左右攙扶。(資料圖片)\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/5023247/org/7c7b128458ceb9b53694b6d0396be579.jpg/fYqP8E7UKievKVLBFVV1BUPNdAB5yviwueonb7nqJ28\"/><figcaption>楊明駕駛曾遇意外，送院時爛醉如泥，需由2名警員左右攙扶。(資料圖片)</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"楊明多次被傳媒拍到返回莊家山頂豪宅。（ig@lisa_chng）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260605/1139569053229387776641523.jpeg/l1RYbVrc3gg2SwHC3nNNGqRNdEBmrrxFtFvoELRb6BA\"/><figcaption>楊明多次被傳媒拍到返回莊家山頂豪宅。（ig@lisa_chng）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"楊明多次被傳媒拍到返回莊家山頂豪宅。（ig@lisa_chng）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260605/1139569050876252160261940.jpeg/fFFR-n2jkP5JGHKUrXk7s6Npzb4wfQtPRwfpEkcH6RI\"/><figcaption>楊明多次被傳媒拍到返回莊家山頂豪宅。（ig@lisa_chng）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"楊明同莊思明經常曝光山頂豪宅內貌。（ig@lisa_chng）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260605/1139569048451813376846923.jpeg/jY-GN5ogmk5-swsfkIQGH1OXNW_nZxo_Kx7WOise1jo\"/><figcaption>楊明同莊思明經常曝光山頂豪宅內貌。（ig@lisa_chng）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"楊明同莊思明經常曝光山頂豪宅內貌，仲有家姐莊思敏。（ig@lisa_chng）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20200811/369878742077673472.jpeg/NNoWdIspA5qSKuq1Sv91C1lMkamKaKlLieHkI4nh5CM\"/><figcaption>楊明同莊思明經常曝光山頂豪宅內貌，仲有家姐莊思敏。（ig@lisa_chng）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"拍拖十年。（ig@lisa_chng）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260605/1139567126844018688283709.png/cfW2U9HEM02bkvujA4lt6rHhpcPcvBmjMNQuajDULmo\"/><figcaption>拍拖十年。（ig@lisa_chng）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"莊思明曾為楊明平反，指佢唔係食軟飯，仲上載天真無邪嘅bb相。（ig@lisa_chng）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260605/1139567089216917504198245.png/jomgexvfDFQmaAStqjorrHwb2qAyDNgT8wjUg_MI1IM\"/><figcaption>莊思明曾為楊明平反，指佢唔係食軟飯，仲上載天真無邪嘅bb相。（ig@lisa_chng）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"拍拖十年宣佈婚訊。（ig@lisa_chng）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260605/1139569178232098816623948.jpeg/I2LT4Pcb931_JvhrXeg5t-wdF7icrt80_Rmpif0ZqYk\"/><figcaption>拍拖十年宣佈婚訊。（ig@lisa_chng）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"拍拖十年宣佈婚訊。（ig@lisa_chng）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260605/1139569175732162560641925.jpeg/fRuL_asBALBwbcLHj_k4LbxP6NqewUk_BNKhLATSoSw\"/><figcaption>拍拖十年宣佈婚訊。（ig@lisa_chng）</figcaption></figure><p>延伸閲讀：</p><p>新婚後榮升燒臘店老闆　楊明揚言攻佔大馬「每條街都有分店」</p><p>楊明「升級」大馬女婿　莊思明堅持大馬完婚：想一家人齊齊整整</p><p>【本文獲「馬來西亞東方網」授權轉載，原文：楊明大馬燒臘店遭MBPJ查封】</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-08-24T08:20:03.282988+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":1126,"images":25,"source":"HK01 娛樂","fallback":"none"}}